The deploy folder contains all production-ready Docker configurations and deployment scripts that orchestrate the complete Shattered Archive platform, including web and game clients/servers with nginx reverse proxy setup. It houses Dockerfiles for each component (game client, game server, web client, web server, and nginx) along with docker-compose files that define how these services work together in both experimental and production environments. This folder serves as the definitive deployment configuration that transforms the development project into a runnable, scalable platform.
